                <pb facs="0374" n="286" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg286"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Powell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-02-09"><hi rendition="#italic">February 9,
                        1904</hi></date>.<lb/>(Received February 16, 1904—12.03
                    a.m.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Powell reports that the consular agent at Samana has informed him that an
                    armed force entered his place on February 9, and took out two refugees.)</p>
            </div>
